  "caveats": [
    "Delory source original published root foraging reduction and relative N uptake stability; KNK reproduces authors filtering and adds direct paired process/output ratio contrasts.",
    "Individual plants share solution batch/trays and source lacks tray IDs; all plant-level bootstrap and label permutation inference is conditional and may be anticonservative.",
    "Significance under filtered 58 vs 60 is sensitive to original author exclusion, notably the separately measured root density effect.",
    "Posthoc paired process/output log ratio contrasts may be robust to original author exclusion but remain within one study and not causal mediation.",
    "No resident plants in phase2; experimental legacy illustrates conditioning mechanism, not direct competition interaction alpha coefficients.",
    "Nuptake is derived final N content not real-time resource uptake flux.",
    "This is one source study with multiple correlated endpoints and plant species, not 24 independent meta studies.",
    "Current KNK frozen v28-v38 and Ecology Letters candidate unchanged."
  ]
}
